					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Ex-Hegemony</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Soupy Sales</b> on <b>February 15, 2005, 09:00:48 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">This is ex-binthaf<br /><br />where did everyone still playing land?<br /><br />I /movelogged my cleric on zek as soon as the server came up, so Pavis, 68 cleric is on his way here (with Kendolin the warrior). He&#039;s KT flagged, but not even elemental (tough to get elemental on Sullon Zek as a neutral)<br /><br />I also have a second cleric account on zek that is time/kt flagged, but I&#039;m not sure what i&#039;m gonna do with that on yet.</div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re: Ex-Hegemony</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Somthing</b> on <b>February 16, 2005, 07:36:39 am</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">I, along with some others, landed in Conviction.&nbsp; Those that are still playing have been spread out amongst the guilds on the server (Conviction, IL, EiE).&nbsp; I&#039;m some are in other guilds, but those I know for sure.<br /><br />I still miss everyone from Hege bunches, but I&#039;ve managed to stay in contact with a couple that aren&#039;t in Conviction.&nbsp; Kirishu and I talk often! :)<br /><br />Hopefully more will reply and let us know where they are...<br /></div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re: Ex-Hegemony</b><br />
					Post by: <b>HandySolo</b> on <b>February 16, 2005, 03:46:02 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">I guess I could take Somthing off ignore some day..&nbsp; &nbsp; :)<br /><br />[added later]&nbsp; I guess in addition to being a wise-ass I could approach answering the question.&nbsp; I&#039;m back into the family guild scene and enjoying a &#039;simpler&#039; life.&nbsp;  :saint:</div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re: Ex-Hegemony</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Serepi</b> on <b>February 16, 2005, 05:29:32 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Heya all.&nbsp; Say hello to Kirishu for me Somthing.&nbsp; (You know I had to break the rules to allow her to recruit, don&#039;t you?&nbsp; Ah, the good ol&#039; days...)&nbsp; Good to see ya Binthaf.&nbsp; And Darken, I still visit the old alma mater sometimes (coincidentally, we went to the same small high school).&nbsp; If you ever come through, look me up, won&#039;t ya?<br /><br />Serp.</div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
