					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re: Ex-Hegemony</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Chubbexul</b> on <b>February 23, 2005, 12:52:55 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Hi Guys,<br /><br />Myself and Nyykademuz are now playing WOW on the Mal&quot;Ganis Server - Horde Side.  I miss everyone from Hegemony very much and hope everyone is doing good.<br /><br />Chubbs<br /><br />Chubbexul<br />LVL 53 Priest on Mal Ganis (WOW)<br />Retired Lvl 67Druid on Rodcet Nife (EQ)<br /></div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
